{"meta":{"id":"record","category":"it/syntax/java/object","title":"record (데이터 클래스) · Java","subtitle":"(JAVA)","summary":"불변 데이터 클래스 — getter · equals 자동, 튜플 대용 Pair","tags":["java","f-object","f-tuple"],"color":"emerald","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-emerald","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-emerald-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">record (데이터 클래스) · Java</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 불변 데이터 클래스 — getter · equals 자동, 튜플 대용 Pair</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">record — 데이터 전용 클래스 (Java 16+)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">public record User(long id, String name) {}\r\n\r\nUser u = new User(1, &quot;kim&quot;);\r\nu.name();                       // getter 자동 생성\r\nu.equals(new User(1, &quot;kim&quot;));   // true — equals / hashCode / toString 자동\r\n\r\nrecord Pair&lt;A, B&gt;(A first, B second) {}   // 튜플 대용\r\nvar p = new Pair&lt;&gt;(&quot;age&quot;, 30);</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">필드는 final — 불변 객체. DTO, 여러 값 반환(튜플 대용)에 사용</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 객체 · 튜플, Python › dataclass</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/object/record","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"object","title":"객체 · 컬렉션","path":"it/syntax/java/object"}],"hasImage":false}